# There is no build step here: the site is index.html, and what you edit is what is
# served. So this file has one job.

# Never a credential in a repository. Nothing here reads a .env -- the DNS and deploy
# keys live outside this repo entirely -- but if a copy ever drifts in, it must not be
# committed. This repository is public.
.env

